/reports/mutation/
/mutation.diff
/stryker.log

# Temporary output created by the schema-plan workflow
/plan_output.txt

# Third-party license notices are generated from bun.lock / Cargo.lock at
# build and check time (`bun run generate:licenses`, run by `build`,
# `prepare:check`, `watch:run` and the Dockerfile). Committing them made every
# lockfile-only change (e.g. Renovate) fail the freshness check.
/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
/client/src/generated/

# Other generated files required for reproducible builds are intentionally
# versioned. Do not ignore crates/video-analyzer/data/*.json.
